		(property "Description" "Car-rail sense: OUT high (EN_BOOST) once the rail is below 10.06 V, low again above ~11 V (11.0-11.3 V over a 2.5-3.3 V cell). Nanopower comparator with 1.242 V +/-1% reference, 1.8-5.5 V supply so it runs straight from the cell, 2.8 uA typical, push-pull output, inputs to the rails. -40..+125 C. SOT-23-6 (tracker-style jellybean, 10k+ in stock)"
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "B.Fab")
			(hide yes)
